<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-19T11:00:49.170Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:00:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks persist in the southern provinces, with two policemen killed in separate incidents and a pipe bomb wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala, while grenade attacks in Trang led to arrests and seizure of bombs. A Chinese suspect was detained in Bangkok after a 100,000‑baht border crossing, and Malaysia appointed a new facilitator for southern Thailand peace talks. Cambodia and Thailand agreed on confidence-building measures at a UNCLOS meeting, and the WTO and multilateral partners reviewed progress on a supply chain finance initiative. Floods in Thailand killed 80, according to reports. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQVjJvd3V4ZjRMZ1BpcnNnVkdFTWFaa1lZM054eDZaOVVKdEN3T1gwQUNoS3ZTQ1ZGODMwdUhveDVMRXhONy1GZHpWNUNWanFNTktZSFNCQzBzMllwQ25ERDBJOVlMZUo5bFUzMElEdG85LS1rT2hJdEIyUHNSd0l0WGVwYXcxMG54Q3FHcG9jNE1KSzNEWTZCb21GYmRGdkNsTDdpYnFWVkg4dU1DMWtv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNMk5tT2VXYXYtdkxZZldDb0xiTVdWQ2lMUzFkTDJyQmZ1UGxBc0lFSVRxNllHbDNHcGlISGVfODJVaFU3YTBKNHl0V3VCenp5UDUzVVVrX3JDLTFmN3lVNDJrZTFOYW55VVN1VTRoemoxcHhKTGFFZmNCanE1TEF2bzRNRUFVeVZIM0pFZXFCRVp2NUhZbmNFYS1peXdBdFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;CamboJA News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOMzNxZVkxUHkwY2M3eW1NdWFfd1ZtejlaUmt3cVhCRkltUEtHVzFZTEliVkZYdnVIX0hZaDc1dUNhTFJlTHVQMmc3X1V5VlZnR2dqNzhfMnB4VDJtN3pZaV96QTdfZndkdExNWTZVT0FpTmdpTjlGUTd6bFZVcV9FR3hGalljVklQZDFzTV9zRldCa3RZSVhwdDZFTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Türkiye Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quo